{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"shield_bronze","model_identifier":"shield_bronze","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## shield_bronze\n\nShield, bronze.\n\n- Cubes: 8 (0 rotated). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -3.0..1.0, y -12.0..12.0, z -12.0..12.0 (size 4.0 x 24.0 x 24.0 u = 11 x 68 x 68 cm).\nBronze round shield, about 70 cm (24 u) across, built from three stepped boards (an octagon-ish disc) with a bronze facing, dark bronze rim, a pattern of raised dots and a central boss. Worn on the forearm: origin = **slot_shield_l**; the face points outward (-X) with the arm hanging; the leather grip sits on the arm side (+X).\n"},"description":"## shield_bronze\n\nShield, bronze.\n\n- Cubes: 8 (0 rotated). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -3.0..1.0, y -12.0..12.0, z -12.0..12.0 (size 4.0 x 24.0 x 24.0 u = 11 x 68 x 68 cm).\nBronze round shield, about 70 cm (24 u) across, built from three stepped boards (an octagon-ish disc) with a bronze facing, dark bronze rim, a pattern of raised dots and a central boss. Worn on the forearm: origin = **slot_shield_l**; the face points outward (-X) with the arm hanging; the leather grip sits on the arm side (+X).\n","resolution":{"width":64,"height":64},"elements":[{"name":"board_0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-1.0,-12.0,-4.0],"to":[0.0,-10.0,4.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[32,32,33.0,34.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[48,29,56.0,31.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[33,32,34.0,34.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[56,29,64.0,31.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[56,0,57.0,8.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[57,0,58.0,8.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"8ebc8760-a202-51b6-b073-49f58c81eb81"},{